Main MU to Successor with Number [text box] - DismantleStation
Type in the number of the successor to which the DismantleStation moves the main MU.
Remarks
If you type in a MU Target, the Worker carries all MUs to this target.
If you do not type in a MU Target, the Dismantle Table or the setting Main MU to Successor with
Number determine it.
You cannot use 0 to send the main MU on. If you do type in 0 and click Apply or OK, Plant Simulation
changes 0 to the default value 1. If you assign 0 to the attribute Main MU, Plant Simulation shows an error
message.
