Exiting MU [drop-down list] - DismantleStation
Select the Exiting MU, i.e., how the DismantleStation moves the main MU or a new MU on to its
successor.
Remarks
You can select one of these settings:
• Main MU
The DismantleStation moves the main MU on to the succeeding object.
• New MU
The DismantleStation deletes the main MU, creates a new MU, and moves it on to the successor. The
DismantleStation then shows the text box MU.
Type the path to the class of the new MU into the text box, or click the button 
  and select the new MU
in the dialog Select Object.
